"private  subroutine symmetric_solver_solve(me, b, ok, refine) solve with the factorization of symmetric_solver_factor : b is overwritten by x . The solution is improved by iterative\nrefinement (up to max_refine steps, each one more solve, while the\nresidual is above roundoff and each step at least halves\nit), unless refine is false. ok is false if there is no\nfactorization, the backend reports that the solve failed ( b is then\nunchanged, and out_of_memory is set if an allocation failed), or the\nsolution isn't finite. If a solve of the refinement fails, the\nrefinement stops, and the solution found so far is returned. Type Bound sqpopt_symmetric_solver_type Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( sqpopt_symmetric_solver_type ), intent(inout) :: me real(kind=wp), intent(inout), dimension(:) :: b the right-hand side, overwritten by the solution dimension(n) logical, intent(out) :: ok whether a solution was found logical, intent(in), optional :: refine whether to refine the solution (default .true. ) Calls proc~~symmetric_solver_solve~~CallsGraph proc~symmetric_solver_solve sqpopt_symmetric_solver_type%symmetric_solver_solve back_solve back_solve proc~symmetric_solver_solve->back_solve proc~sqpopt_all_finite sqpopt_all_finite proc~symmetric_solver_solve->proc~sqpopt_all_finite proc~symmetric_solver_multiply sqpopt_symmetric_solver_type%symmetric_solver_multiply proc~symmetric_solver_solve->proc~symmetric_solver_multiply multiply multiply proc~symmetric_solver_multiply->multiply Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Called by proc~~symmetric_solver_solve~~CalledByGraph proc~symmetric_solver_solve sqpopt_symmetric_solver_type%symmetric_solver_solve proc~kkt_solve sqpopt_kkt_type%kkt_solve proc~kkt_solve->proc~symmetric_solver_solve proc~low_rank_update low_rank_update proc~low_rank_update->proc~symmetric_solver_solve proc~direct_qp_step direct_qp_step proc~direct_qp_step->proc~kkt_solve proc~kkt_factor sqpopt_kkt_type%kkt_factor proc~direct_qp_step->proc~kkt_factor proc~inertia_correct sqpopt_inertia_type%inertia_correct proc~direct_qp_step->proc~inertia_correct proc~kkt_factor->proc~low_rank_update proc~least_squares_min_norm sqpopt_least_squares_type%least_squares_min_norm proc~least_squares_min_norm->proc~kkt_solve proc~least_squares_multipliers sqpopt_least_squares_type%least_squares_multipliers proc~least_squares_multipliers->proc~kkt_solve proc~inertia_correct->proc~kkt_factor proc~multiplier_estimate multiplier_estimate proc~multiplier_estimate->proc~least_squares_multipliers proc~restoration_step restoration_step proc~restoration_step->proc~least_squares_min_norm proc~soc_step soc_step proc~soc_step->proc~least_squares_min_norm proc~solve_qp_subproblem sqpopt_qp_solver_type%solve_qp_subproblem proc~solve_qp_subproblem->proc~direct_qp_step proc~restoration_phase_step sqpopt_restoration_type%restoration_phase_step proc~restoration_phase_step->proc~solve_qp_subproblem proc~sqpopt_iterate sqpopt_iterate proc~sqpopt_iterate->proc~inertia_correct proc~sqpopt_iterate->proc~multiplier_estimate proc~sqpopt_iterate->proc~restoration_step proc~sqpopt_iterate->proc~solve_qp_subproblem proc~sqpopt_iterate->proc~restoration_phase_step proc~trust_region_step sqpopt_trust_region_type%trust_region_step proc~sqpopt_iterate->proc~trust_region_step proc~trust_region_step->proc~soc_step proc~trust_region_step->proc~solve_qp_subproblem proc~sqpopt_solve sqpopt_type%sqpopt_solve proc~sqpopt_solve->proc~sqpopt_it