d do end subroutine hessian_low_rank_multiply_transpose","tags":"","url":"proc/hessian_low_rank_multiply_transpose.html"},{"title":"hessian_low_rank_middle – sqpopt","text":"private pure subroutine hessian_low_rank_middle(me, a, sigma) the middle matrix of the compact representation, and the sign of its term (see the module documentation). Type Bound sqpopt_hessian_type Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( sqpopt_hessian_type ), intent(in) :: me real(kind=wp), intent(out), dimension(:,:) :: a the matrix dimension(r,r) real(kind=wp), intent(out) :: sigma -1 (BFGS) or +1 (SR1) Calls proc~~hessian_low_rank_middle~~CallsGraph proc~hessian_low_rank_middle sqpopt_hessian_type%hessian_low_rank_middle proc~middle_matrix middle_matrix proc~hessian_low_rank_middle->proc~middle_matrix proc~pair_col pair_col proc~middle_matrix->proc~pair_col Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Called by proc~~hessian_low_rank_middle~~CalledByGraph proc~hessian_low_rank_middle sqpopt_hessian_type%hessian_low_rank_middle proc~low_rank_update low_rank_update proc~low_rank_update->proc~hessian_low_rank_middle proc~kkt_factor sqpopt_kkt_type%kkt_factor proc~kkt_factor->proc~low_rank_update proc~direct_qp_step direct_qp_step proc~direct_qp_step->proc~kkt_factor proc~inertia_correct sqpopt_inertia_type%inertia_correct proc~direct_qp_step->proc~inertia_correct proc~inertia_correct->proc~kkt_factor proc~solve_qp_subproblem sqpopt_qp_solver_type%solve_qp_subproblem proc~